	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_kahaim2_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その２『あの　はなしって　マジなの？▼
てか　いまも　プラズマだんに
けっこう　のこってるもんな▼
ゲーチスさま……▼
いや　ゲーチスって
なんだかんだ　すごかったんだ▼
スゲーちっす　なんちゃって！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その２『あの　話って　マジなの？▼
てか　今も　プラズマ団に
けっこう　残ってるもんな▼
ゲーチスさま……▼
いや　ゲーチスって
なんだかんだ　すごかったんだ▼
スゲーちっす　なんちゃって！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:31:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_HAKAIM
元プラズマ団その２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T11:01:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T09:05:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_kahaim1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その１『な！　なんてことを！▼
Ｎさまに　したことを　しっても
そんなこと　いっちゃうわけ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-05T03:26:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その１『な！　なんてことを！▼
Ｎさまに　したことを　知っても
そんなこと　いっちゃうわけ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
