	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_kahaim2_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その２『とおい　ちほうに　いくのも
あり　だったんじゃないの？▼
プラズマだん　みたいな
そしきって　どこにも　ありそうだし▽
けいけんしゃ　ゆうぐう　されたかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:31:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その２『遠い　地方に　行くのも
あり　だったんじゃないの？▼
プラズマ団　みたいな
組織って　どこにも　ありそうだし▽
経験者優遇　されたかも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-19T13:31:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T10:58:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_HAKAIM
元プラズマ団その２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T11:02:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-09T09:05:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
